<title>FRANCE: Bertrand Faure says Oct sales up 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Bertrand Faure says Oct sales up 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>French car parts manufacturer Bertrand Faure shares rose 4.23 percent after its finance director Philippe Douay said on Thursday sales rose 25 percent in October compared with a year earlier.</p>
<p>At 1337 GMT the shares stood at 185 francs compared with last night's close of 177.5.</p>
<p>Douay said, however, that the year-on-year comparison was affected by a particularly bad October in 1995.</p>
</text>
